      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE MOSS (4) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (30.10) at The Meadows in a Grade 5 over 525m. Has won two of three starts from this draw. Expected to feature in the finish again. RITZA OLD MATE (3) is a promising dog in the frame at 15 of 40 starts including 12 wins and was in the minors again latest (25.26) over 450m at Ballarat. Has a good record at this journey. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. SHALLOW SALLY (1) had been in great form but was out of the placings last run, finishing eighth (25.91) in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Generally fast to begin but was always well back despite the low draw last time. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Cannot be taken lightly. PAW JASTA (8) won with authority last start. Sure to run well again.",
